{"id":"torrey:apostates","source":"torrey","name":"Apostates","slug":"apostates","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Described — De 13:13; Heb 3:12.","refs":[["Deut",13,13,13,13],["Heb",3,12,3,12]]},{"text":"Persecution tends to make — Mt 24:9,10; Lu 8:13.","refs":[["Matt",24,9,24,9],["Matt",24,10,24,10],["Luke",8,13,8,13]]},{"text":"A worldly spirit tends to make — 2Ti 4:10.","refs":[["2Tim",4,10,4,10]]},{"text":"Never belonged to Christ — 1Jo 2:19.","refs":[["1John",2,19,2,19]]},{"text":"Saints do not become — Ps 44:18,19; Heb 6:9; 10:39.","refs":[["Ps",44,18,44,18],["Ps",44,19,44,19],["Heb",6,9,6,9],["Heb",10,39,10,39]]},{"text":"It is impossible to restore — Heb 6:4-6.","refs":[["Heb",6,4,6,6]]},{"text":"Guilt and punishment of — Zep 1:4-6; Heb 10:25-31,39; 2Pe 2:17,20-22.","refs":[["Zeph",1,4,1,6],["Heb",10,25,10,31],["Heb",10,39,10,39],["2Pet",2,17,2,17],["2Pet",2,20,2,22]]},{"text":"Cautions against becoming — Heb 3:12; 2Pe 3:17.","refs":[["Heb",3,12,3,12],["2Pet",3,17,3,17]]},{"text":"Shall abound in the latter days — Mt 24:12; 2Th 2:3; 1Ti 4:1-3.","refs":[["Matt",24,12,24,12],["2Thess",2,3,2,3],["1Tim",4,1,4,3]]},{"text":"Amaziah. — 2Ch 25:14,27.","refs":[["2Chr",25,14,25,14],["2Chr",25,27,25,27]]},{"text":"Professed disciples. — Joh 6:66.","refs":[["John",6,66,6,66]]},{"text":"Hymenaeus and Alexander. — 1Ti 1:19,20.","refs":[["1Tim",1,19,1,19],["1Tim",1,20,1,20]]}],"refCount":27}
